sound MWU.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Please don't apologize. You haven't done anything you need to say "sorry" about.
sound MWV.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text You told me from the beginning that this might happen.
sound MWW.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But I went and got excited on my own and kept telling you that I wanted you to come...
sound MWX.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text And now I've made you rush around and worry...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG34"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG34.png
if intF[1113] == 1
