		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound MWY.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I'm the one who should be apologizing to you. I'm sorry for being so selfish.
text @[Tomoya]
text You weren't being selfish whatsoever... This is something normal.
text @[Tomoya]
text There's nothing selfish about a couple having fun by going on a date...
text @[Tomoya]
text It's such a simple thing...
music ~
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't mind if you ask for things like that more often. I'll keep working to make them happen...
text @[Tomoya]
text No, I wouldn't even call it "work"...
music BGM25B.mp3
text @[Tomoya]
text It's something I want to do...
text @[Tomoya]
text I want to do all kinds of fun things with you, Nagisa...
text @[Tomoya]
text It's just that... we couldn't this time around...
text @[Tomoya]
text So you shouldn't be apologizing, either...
