text @[Tomoya]
text Good morning. I'm sorry about yesterday.
sound MX5.aac
text @[Boss]
text 'Morning. What're you apologizing about?
music ~
sound MX6.aac
text @[Construction Worker]
text Hey, young'un. I heard you went and ran all the way to a job site yesterday?
sound MX7.aac
text @[Construction Worker]
text You've got some spirit in you, especially for a kid these days.
music BGM14.mp3
text I raise my head, astonished.
text They're not all scolding me. In fact, they're praising me.
text @[Tomoya]
text Um... Why....?
sound MX8.aac
text @[Johny]
text "Why"? Because you ran over to that work site, kid.
text @[Tomoya]
text I see.
sound MX9.aac
text @[Johny]
text Hey, Yu-san. Does this kid not know what happened?
text I don't understand what he's saying.
text But it seems like he means Yoshino-san when he talks about "Yu-san," as he comes out from the back of the office.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGYS12"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
