sound MXA.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Oh, it's you, Okazaki. Good morning.
text He's smiling uncharacteristically.
text @[Tomoya]
text Good morning.
sound MXB.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text You've got a strange look on your face.
text @[Tomoya]
text Of course I do. I came here completely expecting to get yelled at...
sound MXC.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Mistakes happen.
sound MXD.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text The important part is how you recover from them.
text There's a sense of composure in his words.
