	fi
fi
sound MXG.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I think you did absolutely everything you could yesterday.
sound MXH.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text So I went around telling everyone about what happened
sound MXI.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text And they all agreed with me.
text @[Tomoya]
text B-But if I hadn't messed up...
