	fi
fi
sound MXJ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I'm used to you goofing up.
text While what Yoshino-san says is true, I'm still not satisfied with the situation.
text @[Tomoya]
text B-But you even spent your day off...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGYS12"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
