text @[Yoshino]
text I didn't do it for you. I did it for our customer.
sound MXL.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That job had to be finished by yesterday.
sound MXM.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Are you still not satisfied?
text I shake my head sideways without saying a word.
text If anything, I feel full of guilt.
text That's why I can't bring myself to take advantage of Yoshino-san's kindness.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGYS10"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
