text A lot of things have started to go smoothly.
text Ever since that day, work has been good.
text I'm refreshed every night after work by talking for hours with Nagisa.
text While waking up in the mornings is still as tough as ever, I'm motivated to get out there when I see Nagisa's sleeping face.
text As for Nagisa, she's started talking to Nishina and Sugisaka more.
text It's because they finally have more time now that they're done with choir club.
text It looks like our lives have started to calm down.
